{%- comment -%}
  Jeden kafel produktu (sn-card) do pobrania skryptem.

  Ta sekcja nie stoi w zadnym szablonie. Rzad "Recently viewed"
  (sections/sn-ostatnio) pobiera ja z adresu
    /products/<handle>?section_id=sn-karta
  i Shopify renderuje ja w kontekscie tego produktu - stad gotowy kafel,
  taki sam jak w kolekcji i w bestsellerach.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- if product != blank -%}
  {%- comment -%} Dzial dla "Recently viewed": mens / womens, puste = unisex albo brak tagu (01.11.2026) {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign dzial = ''
    if product.tags contains 'Department: Men'
      unless product.tags contains 'Department: Women'
        assign dzial = 'mens'
      endunless
    elsif product.tags contains 'Department: Women'
      assign dzial = 'womens'
    endif
  -%}
  <div data-sn-karta="{{ product.handle }}" data-sn-dzial="{{ dzial }}">
    {%- render 'sn-card', product: product, grid_item: false -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Product card (fetch)",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
